      readonly identifier: AdaptySubscriptionOfferId;

      phases: AdaptyDiscountPhase[];

      android?: {
        offerTags?: string[];
      };
    }
    ```

2. [AdaptySubscriptionOfferId](https://react-native.adapty.io/types/adaptysubscriptionofferid) :

